{"id": "843cdd01-eb3d-4035-94db-dc740a2b741a", "slug": "api-landing-page", "title": "API Landing Page", "description": "Api One Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"API Landing Page\"\ndescription: \"Api One Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#CCFF00\"\n  secondary: \"#B8E600\"\n  accent: \"#B8E600\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#1A2E1A\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#1A2E1A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# API Landing Page\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 21; favorites: 3; remixes: 0.\nTags: card, animated, bento, action, effect.\n## Overview\nApi One Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nFor Developers One API. Endless possibilities. Power your product with our blazing fast, reliable, and developer-friendly API. Explore Docs View Playground 4.9 out of 5 Trusted by 12k+ developers +8k POST /v1/checkout 1…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: One API. Endless possibilities.; Payments; Database; Notifications; Webhooks; 99.99%.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #CCFF00, secondary #B8E600, accent #B8E600, background #050505, surface #1A2E1A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>API Landing Page</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'monospace'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        'brand-dark': '#0B0E14',\n                        'brand-panel': '#12161F',\n                        'brand-card': '#161B22',\n                        'brand-green': '#CCFF00',\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-white min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 lg:p-10 font-sans selection:bg-brand-green selection:text-black overflow-x-hidden\">\n\n    <!-- Main Container -->\n    <main class=\"w-full max-w-[1400px] relative bg-brand-dark rounded-3xl border border-white/5 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col\">\n        \n        <!-- Content Grid -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8 p-8 lg:p-14 relative z-10\">\n            \n            <!-- Left Column: Copy -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-1 lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-center z-20\">\n                \n                <!-- Badge -->\n                <div class=\"hero-el opacity-0 translate-y-4 mb-8\">\n                    <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide\">\n                        <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-green shadow-[0_0_8px_#CCFF00]\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"text-white/80 uppercase tracking-widest\">For Developers</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Headline (Masked Reveal) -->\n                <h1 class=\"text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-6\">\n                    <div class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-full\">One</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-full\">API.</span></div>\n                    <br>\n                    <div class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-full\">Endless</span></div>\n                    <br>\n                    <div class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-full text-brand-green relative\">\n                        possibilities.\n                        <svg class=\"absolute -bottom-2 left-0 w-full h-3 text-brand-green opacity-50\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 10\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                            <path class=\"stroke-current draw-line\" d=\"M0,5 Q100,-2 200,8\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </span></div>\n                </h1>\n\n                <!-- Subheadline -->\n                <p class=\"hero-el opacity-0 translate-y-4 text-lg text-slate-400 mb-10 max-w-md font-medium leading-relaxed\">\n                    Power your product with our blazing fast, reliable, and developer-friendly API.\n                </p>\n\n                <!-- Buttons -->\n                <div class=\"hero-el opacity-0 translate-y-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mb-12\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-[#D4FF33] to-[#B8E600] px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-black transition-transform hover:scale-105\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.2);\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:maximize-square-linear\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        Explore Docs\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"18\" class=\"transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-white/10\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-square-linear\" width=\"18\"></iconify-icon>\n                        View Playground\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Trust Section -->\n                <div class=\"hero-el opacity-0 translate-y-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-yellow-500\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-white text-sm font-medium ml-2\">4.9 out of 5</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm\">Trusted by 12k+ developers</span>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"h-8 w-px bg-white/10 hidden sm:block\"></div>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"flex items-center rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-1 pr-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex -space-x-3 mr-3\">\n                            <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=11\" alt=\"User\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-dark relative z-40\">\n                            <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=47\" alt=\"User\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-dark relative z-30\">\n                            <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=12\" alt=\"User\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-dark relative z-20\">\n                            <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=44\" alt=\"User\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-dark relative z-10\">\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-300\">+8k</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Column: Visuals & Cards -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-1 lg:col-span-7 relative flex justify-center lg:justify-end items-center mt-12 lg:mt-0 min-h-[500px]\">\n                \n                <!-- Background Ambient Glow -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-brand-green/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Central 3D Graphic (Approximation) -->\n                <div class=\"absolute left-0 lg:left-10 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-full max-w-[400px] h-[500px] pointer-events-none z-10 hidden md:block\" style=\"perspective: 1200px;\">\n                    \n                    <!-- Base Rings -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[340px] h-[340px]\" style=\"transform: rotateX(75deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full border-[3px] border-brand-green/20\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.1);\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-4 rounded-full border border-brand-green/30\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.2);\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-10 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-green/50 bg-brand-green/5\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.4), inset 0 0 20px rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.2);\"></div>\n                        \n                        <!-- Radar Scan Line -->\n                        <div class=\"radar-scan absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 w-1/2 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-brand-green to-transparent origin-left opacity-50\" style=\"transform: translateY(-50%);\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Center Glowing Cube -->\n                    <div class=\"pulse-cube absolute bottom-24 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-20 h-24 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-green/40 to-transparent border border-brand-green/50 flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-sm\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.6), inset 0 0 30px rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.4); z-index: 5;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-bold\" width=\"32\" class=\"text-brand-green drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_#CCFF00]\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Floating Code Panel -->\n                    <div class=\"float-panel absolute top-10 left-0 w-[420px] rounded-2xl bg-[#0F131A]/80 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden z-20\" style=\"transform: rotateY(15deg) rotateX(5deg) translateZ(50px);\">\n                        \n                        <!-- Panel Header -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 border-b border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <span class=\"text-brand-green font-mono text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide\">POST</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-300 font-mono text-sm\">/v1/checkout</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-green shadow-[0_0_8px_#CCFF00]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Panel Body (Code) -->\n                        <div class=\"p-5 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm leading-loose overflow-hidden relative\">\n                            <!-- Orbiting Dot behind code -->\n                            <div class=\"orbit-dot absolute top-1/2 -left-4 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white shadow-[0_0_10px_white]\"></div>\n\n                            <table class=\"w-full text-slate-400\">\n                                <tbody>\n                                    <tr><td class=\"pr-4 text-slate-600 select-none border-r border-white/10 w-8 text-right\">1</td><td class=\"pl-4\"><span class=\"text-slate-300\">{</span></td></tr>\n                                    <tr><td class=\"pr-4 text-slate-600 select-none border-r border-white/10 w-8 text-right\">2</td><td class=\"pl-8\"><span class=\"text-brand-green\">\"user_id\"</span>: <span class=\"text-blue-300\">\"usr_01HD82\"</span>,</td></tr>\n                                    <tr><td class=\"pr-4 text-slate-600 select-none border-r border-white/10 w-8 text-right\">3</td><td class=\"pl-8\"><span class=\"text-brand-green\">\"amount\"</span>: <span class=\"text-orange-300\">129.00</span>,</td></tr>\n                                    <tr><td class=\"pr-4 text-slate-600 select-none border-r border-white/10 w-8 text-right\">4</td><td class=\"pl-8\"><span class=\"text-brand-green\">\"currency\"</span>: <span class=\"text-blue-300\">\"USD\"</span>,</td></tr>\n                                    <tr><td class=\"pr-4 text-slate-600 select-none border-r border-white/10 w-8 text-right\">5</td><td class=\"pl-8\"><span class=\"text-brand-green\">\"status\"</span>: <span class=\"text-orange-300\">\"success\"</span>,</td></tr>\n                                    <tr><td class=\"pr-4 text-slate-600 select-none border-r border-white/10 w-8 text-right\">6</td><td class=\"pl-8\"><span class=\"text-brand-green\">\"timestamp\"</span>: <span class=\"text-orange-300\">1717068900</span></td></tr>\n                                    <tr><td class=\"pr-4 text-slate-600 select-none border-r border-white/10 w-8 text-right\">7</td><td class=\"pl-4\"><span class=\"text-slate-300\">}</span></td></tr>\n                                </tbody>\n                            </table>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <!-- Panel Edge Highlight -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 right-0 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-brand-green/30 to-transparent\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Connection Lines (SVG) -->\n                    <svg class=\"absolute top-0 right-[-150px] w-[300px] h-[500px] pointer-events-none z-10\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 500\" fill=\"none\">\n                        <!-- Line 1: To Payments -->\n                        <path class=\"conn-line\" d=\"M 0 150 C 150 150, 150 50, 300 50\" stroke=\"url(#grad1)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\" />\n                        <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"50\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#CCFF00\" class=\"conn-dot shadow-[0_0_8px_#CCFF00] drop-shadow-md\" />\n                        <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"150\" r=\"4\" fill=\"transparent\" stroke=\"#CCFF00\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n\n                        <!-- Line 2: To Database -->\n                        <path class=\"conn-line\" d=\"M 0 180 C 120 180, 120 130, 300 130\" stroke=\"url(#grad1)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n                        <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"130\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#CCFF00\" class=\"conn-dot drop-shadow-md\" />\n                        <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"180\" r=\"4\" fill=\"transparent\" stroke=\"#CCFF00\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n\n                        <!-- Line 3: To Notifications -->\n                        <path class=\"conn-line\" d=\"M 0 210 C 150 210, 150 200, 300 200\" stroke=\"url(#grad1)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n                        <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"200\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#CCFF00\" class=\"conn-dot drop-shadow-md\" />\n                        <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"210\" r=\"4\" fill=\"transparent\" stroke=\"#CCFF00\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n\n                        <!-- Line 4: To Webhooks -->\n                        <path class=\"conn-line\" d=\"M 0 240 C 150 240, 150 270, 300 270\" stroke=\"url(#grad1)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n                        <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"270\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#CCFF00\" class=\"conn-dot drop-shadow-md\" />\n                        <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"240\" r=\"4\" fill=\"transparent\" stroke=\"#CCFF00\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n\n                        <defs>\n                            <linearGradient id=\"grad1\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\">\n                                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#CCFF00\" stop-opacity=\"0.8\" />\n                                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#CCFF00\" stop-opacity=\"0.1\" />\n                            </linearGradient>\n                        </defs>\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Stacked Feature Cards -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 relative z-30 w-full max-w-[280px] lg:ml-auto\">\n                    \n                    <!-- Card 1 -->\n                    <div class=\"feature-card opacity-0 translate-x-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 to-transparent p-[1px] hover:from-brand-green/30 transition-colors duration-500 cursor-default\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-brand-card px-5 py-4 h-full\">\n                            <div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-green-500/10 text-brand-green\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:card-linear\" width=\"22\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Payments</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5\">Stripe, Checkout</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Card 2 -->\n                    <div class=\"feature-card opacity-0 translate-x-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 to-transparent p-[1px] hover:from-purple-500/30 transition-colors duration-500 cursor-default\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-brand-card px-5 py-4 h-full\">\n                            <div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" width=\"22\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Database</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5\">PostgreSQL</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Card 3 -->\n                    <div class=\"feature-card opacity-0 translate-x-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 to-transparent p-[1px] hover:from-orange-500/30 transition-colors duration-500 cursor-default\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-brand-card px-5 py-4 h-full\">\n                            <div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bell-linear\" width=\"22\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Notifications</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5\">Email, SMS, Push</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Card 4 -->\n                    <div class=\"feature-card opacity-0 translate-x-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 to-transparent p-[1px] hover:from-cyan-500/30 transition-colors duration-500 cursor-default\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-brand-card px-5 py-4 h-full\">\n                            <div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:programming-linear\" width=\"22\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Webhooks</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5\">Real-time events</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Status Card -->\n                    <div class=\"feature-card opacity-0 translate-x-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-green/20 to-transparent p-[1px] mt-4 relative overflow-hidden group cursor-default\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-green/5 group-hover:bg-brand-green/10 transition-colors\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-brand-card px-5 py-5 relative z-10\">\n                            <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#1A2E1A] border border-brand-green/30 relative\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-brand-green animate-[ping_3s_ease-in-out_infinite] opacity-20\"></div>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" width=\"24\" class=\"text-brand-green\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white tracking-tight\">99.99%</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5\">Uptime</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Feature Bar -->\n        <div class=\"w-full px-8 lg:px-14 pb-8 lg:pb-10 relative z-20 mt-4 lg:mt-0\">\n            <div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-brand-card/50 backdrop-blur-sm p-2 flex flex-col md:flex-row divide-y md:divide-y-0 md:divide-x divide-white/10\">\n                \n                <!-- Bottom Item 1 -->\n                <div class=\"bottom-item opacity-0 translate-y-4 flex-1 flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-4 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors rounded-xl md:rounded-none md:rounded-l-xl\">\n                    <div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/5 text-purple-400\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rocket-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Blazing Fast</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5\">~120ms avg response</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bottom Item 2 -->\n                <div class=\"bottom-item opacity-0 translate-y-4 flex-1 flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-4 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\">\n                    <div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/5 text-yellow-400\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Enterprise Grade</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5\">Bank-level security</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bottom Item 3 -->\n                <div class=\"bottom-item opacity-0 translate-y-4 flex-1 flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-4 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\">\n                    <div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/5 text-brand-green\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:infinity-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Highly Scalable</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5\">Built for millions</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bottom Item 4 -->\n                <div class=\"bottom-item opacity-0 translate-y-4 flex-1 flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-4 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\">\n                    <div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/5 text-green-400\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Extremely Easy</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5\">Simple integration</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bottom Item 5 -->\n                <div class=\"bottom-item opacity-0 translate-y-4 flex-1 flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-4 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors rounded-xl md:rounded-none md:rounded-r-xl\">\n                    <div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/5 text-slate-300\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:users-group-two-rounded-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Loved by Devs</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5\">12k+ developers</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // 1. Masked Word Reveal for Headline\n            gsap.to(\".reveal-word\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            // 2. Fade/Slide up for Hero Elements\n            gsap.to(\".hero-el\", {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                delay: 0.6\n            });\n\n            // 3. Staggered reveal for right cards\n            gsap.to(\".feature-card\", {\n                x: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                delay: 1\n            });\n\n            // 4. Staggered reveal for bottom bar items\n            gsap.to(\".bottom-item\", {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 0.6,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                stagger: 0.05,\n                delay: 1.5\n            });\n\n            // 5. Draw SVG lines\n            gsap.fromTo(\".conn-line\", \n                { strokeDasharray: \"0 1000\" }, \n                { strokeDasharray: \"1000 0\", duration: 2, ease: \"power2.inOut\", delay: 1.2 }\n            );\n\n            // 6. Continuous Floating Animation for Panel\n            gsap.to(\".float-panel\", {\n                y: \"-=15\",\n                rotationX: \"+=2\",\n                rotationY: \"-=2\",\n                duration: 4,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1\n            });\n\n            // 7. Continuous Pulsing for Center Cube\n            gsap.to(\".pulse-cube\", {\n                boxShadow: \"0 0 80px rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.8), inset 0 0 40px rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.6)\",\n                scale: 1.05,\n                duration: 2,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1\n            });\n\n            // 8. Radar Scan rotation\n            gsap.to(\".radar-scan\", {\n                rotation: 360,\n                duration: 4,\n                ease: \"linear\",\n                repeat: -1,\n                transformOrigin: \"left center\"\n            });\n            \n            // 9. Orbit Dot animation\n            gsap.to(\".orbit-dot\", {\n                rotation: 360,\n                x: 50,\n                y: 100,\n                duration: 8,\n                ease: \"linear\",\n                repeat: -1,\n                transformOrigin: \"200px center\",\n                modifiers: {\n                    x: gsap.utils.unitize(x => Math.cos(x * Math.PI / 180) * 50),\n                    y: gsap.utils.unitize(y => Math.sin(y * Math.PI / 180) * 150)\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "api-landing-page.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/api-landing-page.jpg", "source_name": "api-landing-page-DESIGN.md", "views": 58, "forks": 0, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T16:39:23.698798+00:00"}